Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,制作：哆啦俱乐部 doraclub.cn\N校对：Mizui Bakufu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:30.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博伊迦下午毁灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.61,0:00:36.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 被那个神秘天体的重力摧毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.57,0:00:38.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样的距离竟然也能波及到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.78,0:00:40.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然拥有这么大的马力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.91,0:00:46.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题是那个天体正在朝地球逼近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:50.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去地球一定会...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.05,0:00:55.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球的末日吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.26,0:01:01.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解析出来了 博伊迦最后发送的影像
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在正传往你那边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.85,0:01:05.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.39,0:01:05.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.81,0:01:08.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确认了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:10.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.52,0:01:11.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放出影像
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.82,0:01:55.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比君
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.99,0:02:02.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 到底要说什么你才会明白啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.53,0:02:04.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直都是这种分数
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.33,0:02:05.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道不害羞吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.37,0:02:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了 你完全不理解学习的重要性
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.38,0:02:19.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人说数学这种东西\N只要掌握简单的公式和方法就能够学好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.30,0:02:20.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实不是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:23.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.43,0:02:22.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了吗 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:26.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解开难题就是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.35,0:02:28.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并不只要解开而已
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.69,0:02:29.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.19,0:02:31.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就会去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.56,0:02:35.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要好好向别人学习
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.81,0:02:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是三人一起去 不是不行的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.90,0:02:39.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依靠他人是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.15,0:02:40.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.07,0:02:40.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:57.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.59,0:02:58.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.80,0:02:59.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:04.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天说了那么多 一点也没有收拾嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.43,0:03:10.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天不全部收拾完不许吃完饭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.07,0:04:01.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:10.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鼓鼓的脸庞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.79,0:04:12.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忧郁的面孔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.62,0:04:15.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然时常会有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.08,0:04:17.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哭泣的脸庞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.88,0:04:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不高兴的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:25.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎样也不能垂头丧气
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇伊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.26,0:04:31.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放春假一样的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.10,0:04:35.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇伊 哇伊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.35,0:04:39.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,口袋里装满了梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:42.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨伊 嗨伊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要能和你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.99,0:04:49.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨伊 嗨伊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:52.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有梦想都能实现
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.58,0:04:57.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们拥抱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:05:01.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大人小孩 我们一起拥抱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:04.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们拥抱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.13,0:05:08.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小狗也好小猫也好 我们一起拥抱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.01,0:05:13.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 现在正在解析资料
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.64,0:05:15.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后会变得怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.27,0:05:18.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会对地球有什么影响
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.57,0:05:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你们担心的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:22.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:32.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收拾完了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.96,0:05:43.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干什么啊 哭什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.17,0:05:48.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《超能力魔美》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.22,0:05:54.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是魔美
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.77,0:05:59.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,房间变得干净漂亮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.19,0:06:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作业也拜托了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:12.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.95,0:06:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么要去比赛了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:19.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,球棒君 今天也拜托了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK 交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:25.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猪猪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.64,0:06:31.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:36.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:37.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.40,0:06:41.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.90,0:06:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法啊 只要有魔法就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.70,0:06:57.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有什么魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.08,0:06:59.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.41,0:07:02.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前被称为魔法的不可思议的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.79,0:07:06.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部都被现代的科学所解释了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:08.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法呢 只是迷信而已
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.97,0:07:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到原有的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:22.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷信被终止 取而代之的就是科学的力量了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:27.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是科学而是魔法繁荣的话就好了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.78,0:07:31.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要能够使用魔法的话 肯定会更加便利的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.28,0:07:34.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个咒语就能搞定一切呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.83,0:07:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.38,0:07:44.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地震吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:47.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.75,0:07:49.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.86,0:08:07.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.40,0:08:11.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从天而降
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.16,0:08:19.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 在干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.70,0:08:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.37,0:08:24.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是弄坏什么了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.96,0:08:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:30.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底干了什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.51,0:08:34.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难得都收拾完了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.76,0:08:37.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:48.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变得干净了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.29,0:09:01.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.58,0:09:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫他们正在空地哪里欺负大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.71,0:09:07.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:12.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你才输了的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.01,0:09:13.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.42,0:09:15.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的石像
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.60,0:09:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:22.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个石像是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.31,0:09:25.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要把这种东西放在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:26.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:27.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的好 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:36.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿回去的话又会因垃圾增加而被责骂的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.57,0:09:37.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么叫垃圾啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:39.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我的石像哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.33,0:09:42.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是谁做了这东西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做的真像呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.75,0:09:50.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直就像是活的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.05,0:09:54.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像是看到什么可怕的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.30,0:09:57.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样僵在哪一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.55,0:10:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道说这个是被魔法变成石像的我们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.68,0:10:03.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.10,0:10:06.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么在这里的我们算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.94,0:10:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话虽如此
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:10.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是说了吗 没有什么魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:14.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过从天上掉下来有些奇怪 总之是奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.16,0:10:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 赶快 赶快
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.41,0:10:26.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石像流汗了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:36.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说回来 刚才电视里面说台风接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.80,0:10:39.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是汗而是雨啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:50.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快擦干身子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.73,0:10:51.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.12,0:11:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对听到了 奇怪的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:09.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会是爸爸的梦话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:10.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.26,0:11:23.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么吗 只不过是玄关的门开了而已啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.22,0:11:26.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 是吗 什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.27,0:11:34.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.36,0:11:36.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁在那
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.33,0:11:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:51.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.09,0:12:00.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄这么晚了干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.42,0:12:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 妈妈 在这边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.31,0:12:09.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个破烂是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.97,0:12:11.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,擅自进来的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:13.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明扔在院子里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.39,0:12:16.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能 石像不可能走路的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.15,0:12:19.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,半夜里开这种玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:20.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快收拾完
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.82,0:12:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.32,0:12:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要收拾完啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.62,0:12:29.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面是暴雨呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有办法暂时放在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个形状和刚才不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.38,0:12:38.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.18,0:12:51.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.27,0:12:55.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个石像很奇怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.56,0:12:59.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是很奇怪呢明天调查吧 我困了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.73,0:13:02.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太在意了睡不着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:05.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想些快乐的事情便能睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.57,0:13:09.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快乐的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:13.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能够使用魔法的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.75,0:13:17.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.38,0:13:23.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我感觉真的能够使用魔法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.59,0:13:25.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个死心眼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有什么魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.14,0:13:31.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.93,0:13:35.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在想到了很好的点子 可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:36.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:40.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.44,0:13:43.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嘛 我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:45.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再叫我了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.91,0:13:51.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:52.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子突然
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:53.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.91,0:13:57.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紧急事态发生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.13,0:13:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.00,0:14:02.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要回22世纪一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.34,0:14:03.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.34,0:14:04.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.34,0:14:07.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就回来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.43,0:14:14.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才的石像没有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.31,0:14:20.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是白天30个铜锣烧的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:28.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.45,0:14:30.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.07,0:14:32.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.24,0:14:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不痛了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:43.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有事情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.76,0:14:47.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天尽是些奇怪的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.38,0:14:50.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我 放开我 放开我...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.93,0:14:54.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好好接受定期检查才会变成这样啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.68,0:14:56.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖地进去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.77,0:14:57.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.52,0:15:01.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,枕头呀 飘起来（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.82,0:15:07.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.40,0:15:09.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.41,0:15:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能够使用魔法的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.45,0:15:15.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:18.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 如果
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.08,0:15:22.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:24.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.42,0:15:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:34.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不疼了并不代表好了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.51,0:15:38.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要想办法治好哆啦A梦的医院讨厌症
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.27,0:15:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 肚子怎么样 没有关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:51.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有什么 只是吃多了而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:54.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛 是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:56.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:16:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面想到了 刚才说的点子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.29,0:16:02.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:04.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果电话亭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:09.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要打电话幻想世界就能成真的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.80,0:16:12.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.84,0:16:18.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微改变成魔法世界试一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.85,0:16:21.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像很有趣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.98,0:16:26.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄只有这种时候才会动脑子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.86,0:16:28.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果电话亭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.82,0:16:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是一会哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.90,0:16:34.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩过了魔法 马上就变回原来的世界哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.11,0:16:35.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:45.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.04,0:16:54.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成魔法世界的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.23,0:17:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就能够使用魔法了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.73,0:17:10.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞往天际的座垫 飞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.86,0:17:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,MA MI MA MI RU RU PA KU  RIN PA（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.99,0:17:15.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铜锣烧出来吧 KU RO RIN PA（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.82,0:17:20.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咒语不对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:22.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,NOBI NOBI RU RU PA KU RU RIN PA（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:25.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ABURA GA BURA（咒语）出来吧 铜锣烧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:32.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垫子飞吧......
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:32.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铜锣烧出来......
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.51,0:17:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有反应
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.76,0:17:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是奇怪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.47,0:17:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的道具一直都派不上用场
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:41.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是说了吗 根本没有什么魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.56,0:17:46.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成老狐狸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.64,0:17:47.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成蚯蚓
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.48,0:17:48.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成虫子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.44,0:17:49.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成微生物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.61,0:17:50.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成猪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.65,0:17:51.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成虚无
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.82,0:17:53.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成胡萝卜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.87,0:18:02.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.20,0:18:03.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天尽是些怪事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.60,0:18:30.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴玛奥大人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.03,0:18:36.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些家伙是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.99,0:18:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是为了打倒我而来魔界的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.33,0:18:45.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自作聪明的地球人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.66,0:18:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:52.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美杜莎让我看看你的力量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:52.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.06,0:19:13.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雨好像停止了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.79,0:19:30.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大...大...大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 大雄赶快起来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.23,0:19:56.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.03,0:20:08.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是魔法的世界啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.58,0:20:16.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:18.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.88,0:20:19.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要迟到哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.13,0:20:25.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会迟到的呢 用飞天的魔毯一下子就到了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.51,0:20:27.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么胡话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.64,0:20:30.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们家没有会飞天的魔毯的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:31.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.85,0:20:33.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要那么贵的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.19,0:20:36.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄也赶快学会骑扫帚走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.19,0:20:41.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比君 你连这种事情都做不到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.90,0:20:45.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,物体浮游术不是魔法的基础吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.20,0:20:48.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.83,0:20:52.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放松自己 咏唱CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.21,0:20:54.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.21,0:20:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI......
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.80,0:21:01.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在干些什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.38,0:21:01.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.88,0:21:02.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来做
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.59,0:21:08.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.43,0:21:13.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.56,0:21:14.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.27,0:21:16.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.62,0:21:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你这不会飞的家伙真没用
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:33.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:37.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弘君赶快 咪咪等我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.59,0:21:44.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 听了老师的话我简直无地自容了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.22,0:21:48.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,物体浮游术是基础的基础啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.34,0:21:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能好好的使用魔法到底能去什么学校呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.52,0:22:02.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和原本的世界一点都没有改变呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.15,0:22:03.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.24,0:22:06.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.78,0:22:11.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看样子魔法和学习一样都是需要努力的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.33,0:22:17.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能使用魔法是因为没有学过呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.13,0:22:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变回原来的世界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.72,0:22:34.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 大雄去游扫帚河吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.14,0:22:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.14,0:22:37.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游扫帚河
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.56,0:22:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是游车河的扫帚版吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.56,0:22:44.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸给我买了德国制的最新型号
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.82,0:22:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样 这个不失外观的美
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.15,0:22:50.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还充满了柔美的设计曲线
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.66,0:22:53.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是特别限定的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.49,0:22:57.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样 让你坐一回还是可以的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.66,0:23:02.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的小夫 大雄不会骑扫帚哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.17,0:23:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.46,0:23:06.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思约错你了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:07.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.63,0:23:09.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.13,0:23:10.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧 去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.26,0:23:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.47,0:23:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 不管在什么世界那两人做的事情都是一样的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.35,0:23:22.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么变回原来的世界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.40,0:23:24.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.19,0:23:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难得变成魔法的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.07,0:23:34.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起码是最简单的魔法也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.83,0:23:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要学会用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.33,0:23:42.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以大雄来说真是不错的毅力呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.25,0:23:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.09,0:23:48.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不行 这么用力
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.63,0:23:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微再冷静一些
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.59,0:23:52.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.01,0:23:56.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要放弃 刚才稍微动了一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.26,0:23:57.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.39,0:23:59.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.81,0:24:00.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.44,0:24:02.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.73,0:24:03.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.65,0:24:05.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.86,0:24:07.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.15,0:24:09.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不动呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.94,0:24:11.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能够心急
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.24,0:24:12.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要再冷静一些
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.20,0:24:15.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,深深的呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.99,0:24:19.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后只想着让人偶浮起来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.95,0:24:23.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飘起来 飘起来 CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.50,0:24:25.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.80,0:24:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浮吧 HOE
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.01,0:24:35.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了嘛 裙子稍微动了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.84,0:24:36.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.93,0:24:38.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简单的东西还是可以做到的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.89,0:24:41.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.86,0:24:50.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.82,0:24:51.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.99,0:24:52.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.41,0:24:56.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我适可而止
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.33,0:25:00.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.45,0:25:01.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.58,0:25:02.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不理你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.71,0:25:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 原谅我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.92,0:25:09.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.30,0:25:16.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,流星
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.47,0:25:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑色的流星吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.28,0:25:36.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.66,0:25:41.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.66,0:25:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.33,0:25:44.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.75,0:25:47.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.67,0:25:49.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.01,0:25:54.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.35,0:26:05.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.19,0:26:07.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重要的是平衡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.73,0:26:09.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 平衡 平衡
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.48,0:26:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦的这个还真是奇怪的魔法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.11,0:26:18.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个不是魔法哦 是科学力量的结晶超小型的发动机
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.28,0:26:20.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,专门开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.87,0:26:24.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科学什么的是迷信哦 在这个魔法的世界里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.83,0:26:32.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害 变烂了的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.17,0:26:36.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 这一带全部干枯了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.01,0:26:41.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能够做到这样 那个绝对不是普通的流星
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.55,0:26:45.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是什么都没有发现哦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.81,0:26:47.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是什么东西掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.98,0:26:51.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.86,0:26:52.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么动了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.53,0:26:55.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.49,0:26:57.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.61,0:27:00.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.20,0:27:02.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是猴子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.66,0:27:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住它 两面夹击
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.50,0:27:09.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好过分 这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.04,0:27:12.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是那颗流星的关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.21,0:27:16.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是普通的流星哦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.18,0:27:21.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.77,0:27:29.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.81,0:27:30.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.69,0:27:33.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那两人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.62,0:27:46.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.75,0:27:55.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.89,0:28:10.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.85,0:28:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 没有关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.69,0:28:19.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好重 让开
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.24,0:28:23.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.45,0:28:25.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好过分 要被压垮了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.66,0:28:27.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.12,0:28:31.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.96,0:28:40.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果还是掉下来了呢 能站起来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.89,0:28:50.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 救了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.52,0:28:53.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.06,0:28:57.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有受伤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.61,0:29:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有关系哦 你们才是呢  没有关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.69,0:29:01.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.74,0:29:04.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊 魔毯的操纵
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.66,0:29:09.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 别看我这样 魔毯操纵可是A级的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.62,0:29:11.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.33,0:29:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.59,0:29:20.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地震了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.34,0:29:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.34,0:29:25.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.13,0:29:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天 前天
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.80,0:29:28.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近一直都这样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.60,0:29:30.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.39,0:29:32.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界要完了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.22,0:29:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.98,0:29:37.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停止了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.65,0:29:40.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快离开这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.48,0:29:43.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里充满了可疑的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.40,0:29:48.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这片森林干枯也是 因为什么强大魔力的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.37,0:29:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长时间在这片森林里是很危险的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.38,0:30:03.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的德国制扫帚
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.46,0:30:05.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是 没了 没了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.68,0:30:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家乘上我的魔毯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.14,0:30:58.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 没有关系 这些是我的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.61,0:31:04.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害的警备啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.82,0:31:06.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是面对魔物的措施
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.94,0:31:07.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔物
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.15,0:31:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.24,0:31:14.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近的地震和异常现象的增加 是因为魔界星的接近
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.29,0:31:16.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.41,0:31:19.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔界星
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.13,0:31:27.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一片漆黑
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.96,0:31:29.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 是我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.64,0:31:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎大家
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.98,0:31:45.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面对魔物只受了这点伤 你们的运气真好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.15,0:31:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来帮你们疗伤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.45,0:31:54.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请来我的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.33,0:31:56.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.16,0:31:58.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满月牧师
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.87,0:32:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正是满月
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.79,0:32:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害 真正的满月牧师呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.38,0:32:06.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满月牧师是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.80,0:32:08.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.59,0:32:11.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有名的魔法研究者
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.55,0:32:13.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是经常在电视上出现吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.26,0:32:16.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.64,0:32:18.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄真是健忘呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.35,0:32:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满月牧师 刚才说到了魔物
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.94,0:32:27.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个黑色的流星和魔界星有什么关联吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.69,0:32:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在可怕的事情正在地球上发生
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.79,0:32:44.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们相信恶魔的存在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.71,0:32:49.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前存在 但是因为害怕人类的发展而灭亡了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.67,0:32:53.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样说的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.93,0:32:59.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我解析了古文书 得知了可怕的事实
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.02,0:33:02.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据其记载
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.60,0:33:10.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才构建了现在的魔法文明
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.60,0:33:10.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们人类原本是由恶魔所赐予的魔力
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.90,0:33:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是从名为魔界星的天体前来的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.90,0:33:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而这些恶魔不是地球的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.75,0:33:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 恶魔是宇宙人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.79,0:33:34.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是魔界星在历史上好几次接近地球
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.79,0:33:34.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惊讶也是没有办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.88,0:33:38.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐龙的灭绝 诺亚方舟的传说
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.35,0:33:43.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使地球上的生物吧；濒临灭绝的迷之天气
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.48,0:33:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些全是魔界星接近所带来的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.44,0:33:55.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而现在魔界星正在再次接近地球
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.95,0:34:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有任何人相信魔界星和恶魔的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.95,0:34:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是不管我怎么警告
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.25,0:34:06.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是这是事实
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.92,0:34:12.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果魔界星来到世界都能看到的地方 那就晚啦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.26,0:34:18.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是妈妈相信呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.30,0:34:23.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子 不要再提妈妈了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.56,0:34:24.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.64,0:34:26.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是为了拯救别人
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.85,0:34:30.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,借用恶魔的力量也是不可以原谅的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.52,0:34:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.15,0:34:35.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系吧 对不起呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.32,0:34:39.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.03,0:34:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 我重新去泡
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.03,0:34:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.29,0:34:47.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.46,0:34:56.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问 美夜子的妈妈她...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.88,0:35:00.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子的母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.98,0:35:11.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很可惜 现在的魔法是没有办法救孩子的命的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.06,0:35:13.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.02,0:35:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骗人 骗人的 美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.46,0:35:30.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手 在看什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.12,0:35:36.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再有 再有一点力量的话 美夜子就...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.42,0:35:43.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和恶魔交易的话 只会牺牲别人的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.60,0:35:45.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人知道会发生什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.52,0:35:52.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她和恶魔交换了契约
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.77,0:35:55.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她和恶魔交换了契约
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.44,0:35:58.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将自己的生命作为祭品
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.36,0:36:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.04,0:36:21.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕那件事情成为了魔界星接近的开端吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.22,0:36:24.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗 恶魔前来地球了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.26,0:36:28.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有驱除恶魔的方法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.43,0:36:29.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不能说没有
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.36,0:36:38.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是距今5000年前
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.40,0:36:43.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将恶魔族的力量封印了起来的传说
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.40,0:36:43.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有位叫纳鲁尼亚迪斯的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.53,0:36:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个方法的魔界历程隐藏在地球的某个角落
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.53,0:36:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据这个古文献记载
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.12,0:36:57.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么只要有那个魔界历程 就不需要害怕恶魔了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.46,0:37:03.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是这本文书过于陈旧 有关地点无法解读
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.47,0:37:04.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解读
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.47,0:37:09.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翻译魔芋
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.81,0:37:13.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满月牧师 请吃下这个看看
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.10,0:37:14.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔芋
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.19,0:37:15.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃吧 吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.90,0:37:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这...这是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.78,0:37:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害 看得懂了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.36,0:37:27.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.12,0:37:29.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们使用的魔法真厉害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.75,0:37:34.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种不可思议的魔法 还第一次看到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.00,0:37:43.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样即使恶魔来了 也能安心了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.13,0:37:43.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.68,0:37:48.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.60,0:37:49.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.97,0:37:53.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多可以变回原来的世界了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.89,0:37:57.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呢 乘过魔毯 也学会了魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.90,0:38:00.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是掀裙子的事情吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.40,0:38:02.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,物体浮游术啦
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.61,0:38:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 在这里的如果电话亭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.33,0:38:11.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个大箱子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.62,0:38:19.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太碍事了 不知道怎么办 正好收拾垃圾的经过
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.17,0:38:23.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.07,0:38:47.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有如果电话亭的话 就不能变回原来的世界了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.07,0:38:51.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样太不负责任了 快想想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.20,0:38:54.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你创造的世界吗 你要负责
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.79,0:38:57.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么什么都推到我身上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.33,0:39:00.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是什么都推到我身上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.33,0:39:03.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你想到如果电话亭 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.21,0:39:05.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你说事好想法嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.19,0:39:20.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比昨天的更大了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.15,0:39:24.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吸收了星光 魔界星又接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.11,0:39:26.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.99,0:39:28.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.20,0:39:29.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.36,0:39:31.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.82,0:39:34.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样魔界历程就可以到手啦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.28,0:39:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.16,0:39:36.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看这里
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.50,0:39:40.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.58,0:39:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.63,0:39:54.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又吵架了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.31,0:39:57.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,台风又要来了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.72,0:39:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又来了 到处都是这样呢 到底怎么样了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.77,0:40:03.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又来了 到处都是这样呢 到底怎么样了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.72,0:40:35.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这...这是
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.26,0:40:36.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.74,0:40:51.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.66,0:41:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快躲到桌子下面去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.41,0:41:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.02,0:41:26.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是厉害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.23,0:41:29.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定很近啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.57,0:41:33.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让开啊 我来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.03,0:41:34.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.70,0:41:37.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.07,0:41:39.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘记怎么开电视了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.33,0:41:41.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,触动开关 然后输入念力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.08,0:41:48.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超大型的台风依然保持原样正在接近
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.96,0:41:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才发生的地震的详细报道
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.22,0:41:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,震源在多摩东部
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.80,0:41:59.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,震源十分狭窄
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.39,0:42:01.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然很近啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.93,0:42:03.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,树海的森林是
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.43,0:42:05.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子教会的附近
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.56,0:42:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.27,0:42:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.27,0:42:13.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 过分
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.28,0:42:16.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.11,0:42:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 真狡猾啊 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.42,0:42:33.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卑鄙 绝情 不管怎样也不让我赶上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.92,0:42:36.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯规 机械老狐狸
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.64,0:42:44.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.27,0:42:54.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.19,0:42:57.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.99,0:42:59.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.99,0:43:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不介意的话
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.90,0:43:02.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.99,0:43:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...让我们和好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.30,0:43:19.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.80,0:43:23.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.72,0:43:24.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.31,0:43:33.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定能够找到回原来世界的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.31,0:43:33.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生气也没有办法 二人合力的话
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.82,0:43:34.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.94,0:43:37.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快吧 好担心美夜子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.74,0:43:38.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.87,0:43:53.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 这是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.88,0:44:00.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会 不可能 教会消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.34,0:44:04.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.01,0:44:09.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满月牧师
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.23,0:44:13.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底发生什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.56,0:44:17.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子他们 怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.95,0:44:27.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.62,0:44:32.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 这么大的老鼠 到底怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.66,0:44:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.59,0:44:37.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.71,0:44:41.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龙...龙
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.93,0:44:44.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.77,0:44:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也是那小丫头的伙伴吗 看招
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.03,0:45:03.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出现了啊 小丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.32,0:45:06.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.25,0:45:16.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.71,0:45:20.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.94,0:45:40.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.53,0:45:43.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.36,0:45:46.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.28,0:45:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回射斗篷
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.47,0:46:09.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.31,0:46:12.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是惨呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.35,0:46:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 把你们也卷入了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.73,0:46:17.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.35,0:46:20.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子 满月牧师呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.32,0:46:25.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被恶魔族同教会一起带去了异界
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.41,0:46:29.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有我运气好 逃了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.12,0:46:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但还是被刚才的恶魔发现并追上了我
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.79,0:46:36.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好这个古文献安然无恙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.25,0:46:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要找到的话 就可以知道封印恶魔族的办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.21,0:46:44.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要拿着这个潜入魔界星的话
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.51,0:46:45.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔界星
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.38,0:46:50.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不打倒大魔王戴玛奥 他们肯定会到地球来的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.10,0:46:53.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且救爸爸也...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.64,0:46:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了 你们二人也助我一臂之力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.65,0:47:03.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然说这种可怕的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.98,0:47:05.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去魔界星吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.99,0:47:09.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有说不去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.86,0:47:10.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.07,0:47:14.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有三人能够做些什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.37,0:47:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先去找警察商量一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.16,0:47:25.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊再把你们卷进来也不太好 这是我个人的事情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.88,0:47:26.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.76,0:47:33.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.80,0:47:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.46,0:48:04.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么美夜子一个人去魔界了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.63,0:48:07.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 有可能这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.46,0:48:08.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.51,0:48:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是去魔界星实在是不可能的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.64,0:48:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只会使用简单的魔法而已啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.43,0:48:20.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话是这么说没错
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.14,0:48:22.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只会成为累赘啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.48,0:48:25.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 美夜子一个人的话
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.69,0:48:35.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家赶快回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.69,0:48:35.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同学们 下午的课取消了 趁台风还没有更严重
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.28,0:48:37.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.33,0:48:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 小夫 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.48,0:49:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.60,0:49:13.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界各地正受到巨型台风的威胁 灾害范围正在不断扩大
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.53,0:49:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.74,0:49:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.66,0:49:19.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.16,0:49:27.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我国也成立了特别对策小组
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.16,0:49:27.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去的话可能会变成世界的灾难
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.42,0:49:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸也赶快回来就好了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.22,0:49:39.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还以为要死了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.64,0:49:41.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个世界要完结了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.02,0:49:44.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嘛 这个世界完结了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.27,0:49:47.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔界星正在接近啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.57,0:49:56.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.16,0:49:57.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.62,0:50:00.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情变大了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.20,0:50:05.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔界星接近到哪里了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.25,0:50:10.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大地震 巨大台风
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.38,0:50:13.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着世界的完结
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.97,0:50:20.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比大雄先生快递
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.26,0:50:21.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.95,0:50:46.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看这 接招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.71,0:50:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.38,0:50:54.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是老鼠吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.67,0:50:56.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是被诅咒了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.09,0:51:02.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是满月牧师的古文书
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.47,0:51:03.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是美夜子送来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.31,0:51:05.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有信件
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.52,0:51:09.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我如果有什么意外 这个就交给你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.52,0:51:12.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后还给你们添麻烦了 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.32,0:51:13.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.69,0:51:19.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然 一个人去魔界找了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.49,0:51:21.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.66,0:51:28.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 去吧 我们也去
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.79,0:51:32.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.46,0:51:34.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.92,0:51:38.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经有了觉悟呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.09,0:51:41.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我其实不想去
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.76,0:51:46.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是比等魔界星到来 要好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.56,0:51:49.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫真是男人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.73,0:51:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要扔下我
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.02,0:51:52.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.15,0:51:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.61,0:51:55.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.20,0:52:06.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定只会成为累赘 但是仍然不能坐视不理啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.96,0:52:18.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 既然这样的话 魔法帽
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.01,0:52:21.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害 是什么魔法都能够使用的帽子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.13,0:52:23.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 只是普通的装饰
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.47,0:52:26.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是气氛的问题啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.52,0:52:32.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去美夜子身边吓吓她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.36,0:52:35.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.40,0:52:40.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.75,0:52:59.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.55,0:53:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不应该来的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.55,0:53:07.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 不要吵
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.73,0:53:13.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到洞窟前再坚持一下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.94,0:53:14.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洞窟
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.31,0:53:19.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在那里 为了不让恶魔进入而设下的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.65,0:53:24.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该就在这附近 雪太多了 在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.29,0:53:32.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回射斗篷 空气炮
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.67,0:53:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.98,0:54:00.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.44,0:54:04.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 那就是洞窟
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.20,0:54:05.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.78,0:54:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去吸引它们的注意 魔界历程就拜托你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.08,0:54:11.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.79,0:54:13.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人不行 我也来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.79,0:54:19.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香抓住我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.56,0:55:18.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.19,0:55:21.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.73,0:55:27.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.34,0:55:32.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.74,0:55:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.21,0:55:39.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.37,0:55:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了不起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.00,0:55:40.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么了不起的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.31,0:55:57.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.52,0:56:03.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放弃了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.32,0:56:06.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.91,0:56:16.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.75,0:56:20.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.25,0:56:23.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.67,0:56:26.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是害怕魔界历程而逃走了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.34,0:56:28.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 魔界历程呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.93,0:56:37.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到手了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.15,0:56:47.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔界历程我得到了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.90,0:56:49.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.74,0:56:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种东西一定要处理掉啊 对我们来说是碍事的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.41,0:56:58.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你...你是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.87,0:57:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是美夜子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.13,0:57:14.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔族
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.26,0:57:19.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 她被恶魔们袭击了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.73,0:57:23.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愚蠢的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.10,0:57:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是演戏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.52,0:57:30.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 洞窟的结界 恶魔是无法进入的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.19,0:57:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 才利用我们
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.70,0:57:36.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 美夜子怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.95,0:57:42.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要死的人是没有必要知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.95,0:58:28.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四季徽章 夏季
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.09,0:58:36.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四季徽章 夏季
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.35,0:58:46.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 居然被恶魔骗了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.64,0:58:49.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去魔界亏大了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.86,0:58:52.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔居然化身为美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.86,0:58:57.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 幸好我还留了一手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.66,0:59:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个魔界历程是分为两册的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.24,0:59:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说有两本吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.87,0:59:07.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这么一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.41,0:59:11.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么啊 也就是我们还有一半在手咯
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.38,0:59:12.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.05,0:59:18.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易拿到一半 而美夜子他怎么样了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.22,0:59:24.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.68,0:59:28.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是老鼠吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.81,0:59:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪啊 从昨晚开始就一直
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.19,0:59:34.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鼠的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.65,0:59:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪的老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.40,0:59:38.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有项圈的啊 是谁的宠物吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.07,0:59:42.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能 不可能 赶快赶走啦
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.98,1:00:14.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.11,1:00:17.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.07,1:00:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会变成老鼠的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.74,1:00:25.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教会被妖魔袭击了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.45,1:00:28.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸让我逃走了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.50,1:00:33.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是结果还是被恶魔找到 变成了这样
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.13,1:00:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸被带去魔界星了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.55,1:00:40.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我却什么都做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.43,1:00:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子 不要哭 我们会去救满月牧师的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.65,1:00:58.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起去魔界星吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.23,1:01:01.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔族一定会被我们消灭的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.36,1:01:06.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的和我一起去吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.20,1:01:13.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我们拿到魔界历程了 可惜只有一半
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.12,1:01:14.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.25,1:01:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会救出满月牧师的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.25,1:01:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家决定了要从恶魔手中保护地球
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.97,1:01:27.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家多谢了 多谢了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.23,1:01:41.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 醒醒啦
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.45,1:01:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鼠
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.49,1:01:49.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有关系大家现在正在施魔法呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.95,1:01:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算不能变回去也想办法变成其他的样子呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.09,1:02:01.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 我要回去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.21,1:02:03.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是说没事了嘛 样子会变好的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.01,1:02:05.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正也是老鼠样子吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.55,1:02:07.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是说了 不是这样了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.55,1:02:10.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.49,1:02:31.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 这样
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.37,1:02:36.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快拿出翻译魔芋来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.00,1:02:41.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么大家准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.46,1:02:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么向着魔界星
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.68,1:02:51.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.82,1:03:08.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然只要沐浴月光魔法就会解除了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.95,1:03:15.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要被云吞噬了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.00,1:03:23.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要阻止魔界星的接近
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.60,1:03:33.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.01,1:03:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒恶魔的话魔法就会解除的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.89,1:03:40.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么恶魔的魔法碰到月光就会解除呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.27,1:03:44.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月光有封印恶魔魔法的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.48,1:03:49.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月亮一直围绕着地球转的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.07,1:03:55.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了保护地球赐予了月光力量
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.07,1:03:55.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,制作魔界历程的纳鲁尼亚迪斯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.54,1:03:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.12,1:03:59.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月光灯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.75,1:04:05.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个的光和月光一样 和恶魔战斗的时候拿着它就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.84,1:04:09.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实是用来变为狼人的灯呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.63,1:04:10.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会变成狼吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.38,1:04:13.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总比变成老鼠好
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.60,1:04:17.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦真是不可思议的魔法师呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.73,1:04:20.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是这样啦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.73,1:04:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实这是未来的道具 是科学的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.57,1:04:27.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄真是的 相信科学这种迷信
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.15,1:04:29.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真讨厌呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.95,1:04:35.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多要加速了 进到里面去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.24,1:04:36.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.62,1:04:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,入口虽然很窄 里面可是很宽阔的哦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.63,1:04:47.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.63,1:04:50.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明是宇宙却有空气呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.47,1:04:53.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在才发现啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.97,1:04:58.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法世界的宇宙和我们世界的宇宙好像很不同呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.22,1:04:59.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.19,1:05:08.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.48,1:05:11.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.57,1:05:13.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是魔毯里面吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.62,1:05:19.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里下去也有寝室哦
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.00,1:05:23.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到魔界星还有点距离 慢慢休息吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.29,1:05:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道说也有洗澡
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.42,1:05:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然啦
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.21,1:05:28.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真幸福
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.43,1:05:38.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有半本在他们手上吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.97,1:05:42.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是他们现在在冰下呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.06,1:05:47.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愚蠢的家伙 他们现在正在前往魔界星平
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.23,1:05:50.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.65,1:05:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你本来应该没命了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.99,1:06:01.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是魔界历程最重要的部分在他们手中
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.45,1:06:05.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捡回一条命呢 美杜莎
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.75,1:06:08.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.59,1:06:15.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样可以吗 戴玛奥大人 还让美杜莎活着
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.80,1:06:18.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有事要让她干
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.76,1:06:25.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于明白纳鲁尼亚迪斯施下的月光魔法的秘密了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.10,1:06:28.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么终于
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.52,1:06:35.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下个满月那颗星球就会归我所有了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.08,1:06:46.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔毯里面居然能洗澡真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.00,1:06:50.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香真的喜欢洗澡呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.84,1:06:51.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最喜欢了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.96,1:06:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一天全部在浴缸里面也不会腻呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.38,1:06:55.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样会泡没的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.68,1:07:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我小时候头发也有这么长呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.39,1:07:05.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的 为什么剪了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.69,1:07:12.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认为短发比较适合呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.36,1:07:15.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样啊 但是美夜子的话
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.78,1:07:17.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长发也很可爱呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.15,1:07:19.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有那种事情
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.37,1:07:27.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有比现在更短过 最长的时候还有呢 那个时候
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.21,1:07:30.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子的头发十分顺滑呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.83,1:07:32.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像谁呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.29,1:07:33.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.76,1:07:36.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.47,1:07:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 看啊 看啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.47,1:07:50.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可爱 是妈妈弄的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.15,1:07:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 很可爱吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.61,1:08:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.09,1:08:18.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.30,1:08:23.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄怎么了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.38,1:08:27.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 哆啦A梦说吃饭了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.31,1:08:27.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.52,1:08:29.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很厉害的哦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.89,1:08:35.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像桌子一样的道具 说出要吃的东西什么都会出来哦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.52,1:08:41.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真高兴 我肚子已经饿了 直冲食堂吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.16,1:08:50.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.71,1:09:00.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会加油的 拼命加油
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.22,1:09:03.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对会救出美夜子的爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.55,1:09:08.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说好了喔 所以打起精神来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.27,1:09:10.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.69,1:09:16.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.36,1:09:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有精神了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.50,1:09:41.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于到了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.76,1:09:44.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是魔界星啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.55,1:09:51.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要阻止那颗星只有打倒大魔王戴玛奥才行
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.47,1:09:59.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火焰好像很弱
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.47,1:09:59.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包围魔界星的黑色火焰的入口只有一个地方底部
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.48,1:10:04.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是10秒内不通过的话就会化为灰烬
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.78,1:10:06.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有10秒吗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.16,1:10:10.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用全速冲刺也不一定赶得上
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.42,1:10:18.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个就是火焰的裂缝
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.67,1:10:23.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备突入了 大家做好抗冲击准备
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.54,1:10:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还差一点 加油
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.75,1:11:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了 撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.21,1:11:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快出来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.55,1:11:08.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.77,1:11:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快藏起来 恶魔们要来了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.99,1:11:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 来了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.04,1:11:35.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.37,1:11:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好冷 好冷 哆啦A梦把四季徽章拿出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.42,1:11:43.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冰块融化的话我们的位置就会暴露了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.88,1:11:50.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全烧毁了 是地球的东西不会错的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.22,1:11:54.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要突入魔界真是不知好歹呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.47,1:11:56.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乘的人也烧成焦炭了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.77,1:12:03.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许吧 也有可能在空中脱出了 立刻报告戴玛奥大人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.09,1:12:30.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,间谍卫星正在顺利追踪
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.80,1:12:34.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在向大魔王的城堡前进呢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.39,1:12:35.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们准上去
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.15,1:12:44.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.77,1:12:48.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉都快死去了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.49,1:12:51.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脑袋变的好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.57,1:12:53.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能睡着
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.57,1:12:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会这样死去的哦
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.75,1:13:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.00,1:13:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.04,1:13:02.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.71,1:13:04.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.71,1:13:14.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄不能睡着 大雄 起来
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.64,1:13:16.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能睡着啊 不是说了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.97,1:13:18.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好暖和
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.97,1:13:21.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄睁开眼
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.48,1:13:31.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.91,1:13:37.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.24,1:13:43.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微涂了一点居然这么温暖
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.71,1:13:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有这一招啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.63,1:13:48.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.09,1:13:52.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越冷反而感觉越暖和的魔法药膏
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.59,1:13:54.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相反霜
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.72,1:13:57.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家也赶快涂
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.64,1:13:59.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒过来大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.06,1:14:06.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害 浑身发热呢
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.31,1:14:09.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身体不冷了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.78,1:14:13.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你稍微留情一点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.78,1:14:14.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.03,1:14:19.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像太热了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.78,1:14:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你涂多了 稍微弄点下来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.75,1:14:26.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 要越过南极了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.02,1:14:48.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心 终于到恶魔们居住的大陆了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.41,1:15:08.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竹蜻蜓失效了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.67,1:15:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的也是
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.79,1:15:12.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.05,1:15:20.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.03,1:15:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是戴玛奥的城堡啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.49,1:15:44.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸肯定也在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.49,1:15:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要怎么样接近啊 周围都是魔物啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.12,1:15:50.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.75,1:15:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鼹鼠手套
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.96,1:15:56.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.76,1:15:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.27,1:16:08.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往左边修正一点
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.93,1:16:09.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.40,1:16:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找不到
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.57,1:16:19.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽全力找出来
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.49,1:16:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全速前进
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.12,1:16:33.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,右边3度
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.33,1:16:34.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向上2度
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.71,1:16:35.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左边2度
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.46,1:16:37.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停止
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.59,1:16:41.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.88,1:16:43.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是正下方了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.58,1:17:14.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球人们到现在还没有找到 果真是和魔毯一起烧毁了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.21,1:17:19.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微有些骨气的家伙们呢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.68,1:17:31.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.64,1:17:34.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使用骗孩子的把戏
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.82,1:17:46.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个就是大魔王戴玛奥
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.12,1:17:56.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒大魔王戴玛奥的方法只有一个\N就是把这个银制的飞镖插入其心脏
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.25,1:17:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每人各拿2支
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.34,1:18:04.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.97,1:18:07.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月光灯分给大家
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.47,1:18:10.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有盲点星
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.93,1:18:12.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你进入安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.77,1:18:17.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带上这个的人会进入对方的盲点
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.15,1:18:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盲点
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.23,1:18:22.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是他人看不见
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.74,1:18:27.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看得见我吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.57,1:18:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看不见
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.87,1:18:30.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.78,1:18:31.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,流氓
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.88,1:18:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意可疑的家伙就算是一条虫也不要放过
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.06,1:18:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.06,1:18:56.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 算了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.15,1:18:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 就是现在
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.07,1:19:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好广阔啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.49,1:19:10.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之先寻找满月牧师吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.87,1:19:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是这样在哪找啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.87,1:19:14.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.26,1:19:27.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的不要大惊小怪
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.76,1:19:31.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满月牧师
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.43,1:19:32.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安静一些
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.85,1:19:35.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.18,1:19:38.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这上面
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.14,1:19:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.14,1:19:43.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.14,1:19:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.79,1:19:55.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.79,1:20:01.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要关人的话 这里太广阔了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.92,1:20:06.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球人真能够来到这里呢
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.64,1:20:16.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出现了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.18,1:20:18.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是满月牧师
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.18,1:20:20.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是看不见的 为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.90,1:20:27.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小把戏是没有用的 所有都被我看破了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.69,1:20:28.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.07,1:20:33.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大魔王戴玛奥放弃侵略地球撤退吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.58,1:20:37.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不可能吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.95,1:20:43.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球是我们恶魔族花了几千年盯上的猎物
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.79,1:20:46.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放弃是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.96,1:20:49.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.48,1:21:02.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴玛奥增加了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.65,1:21:06.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他的都是幻影
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.73,1:21:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.61,1:21:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.53,1:21:18.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.66,1:21:20.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个才是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.87,1:21:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的力量只有这点程度吗
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.71,1:21:30.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么该我上了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.47,1:21:34.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.43,1:21:38.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.27,1:21:41.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看招
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.53,1:21:54.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.99,1:21:58.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个光芒是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.03,1:22:00.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是现在
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.09,1:22:09.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.31,1:22:22.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有用呢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.69,1:22:27.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.52,1:22:29.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明击中了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.52,1:22:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.79,1:22:43.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碍眼的虫子们
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.85,1:23:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次一定要抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.44,1:23:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要小心 待会儿那帮家伙又会跑掉的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.03,1:23:22.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 大雄 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.91,1:23:25.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快躲起来
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.45,1:23:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要来了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.25,1:23:29.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.25,1:23:40.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了没有
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.25,1:23:40.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家先撤退吧 重新商量对策 城堡的反方向有森林
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.47,1:23:48.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使用了盲点星就全力往那片森林冲刺
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.94,1:23:50.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在森林的入口汇合吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.94,1:23:51.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.90,1:23:52.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.69,1:23:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄赶快带上盲点星
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.53,1:23:54.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄赶快带上盲点星
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.32,1:23:58.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.70,1:23:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全速冲刺
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.28,1:24:02.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.72,1:24:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.10,1:24:25.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.31,1:24:27.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.81,1:24:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么 应该是看不见的才对
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.33,1:24:50.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盲点星
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.55,1:25:02.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.89,1:25:08.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这附近
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.06,1:25:10.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被包围了 已经不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.77,1:25:13.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄带上这个
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.15,1:25:16.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去吸引恶魔的注意力
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.57,1:25:18.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁这个机会逃走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.03,1:25:23.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 我也不能舍下女孩子一个人逃啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.32,1:25:28.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能用魔法吗 能和恶魔战斗吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.83,1:25:32.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个人都在这里被抓 谁来保护地球啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.62,1:25:35.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.05,1:25:44.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 总之现在先逃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.43,1:25:54.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我因为有大家在 不是独自一人 什么都不害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.69,1:26:05.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄叫我拿出勇气的时候真的是十分高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.37,1:26:10.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.60,1:26:40.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定 一定会回来救你的 美夜子
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.24,1:26:52.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月亮一片红呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.12,1:26:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像血一样红呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.38,1:27:01.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁都不会来
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.51,1:27:09.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都被抓住了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.31,1:27:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.64,1:27:19.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么银的飞镖不起作用呢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.02,1:27:25.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是有魔界历程的另一半的话可能就明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.53,1:27:27.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的错
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.11,1:27:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我制作了魔法世界 才会变成这种世界
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.08,1:27:39.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要哭 现在就算说这种事情也不能挽回了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.25,1:27:44.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挽回 有可能成功呢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.21,1:27:47.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么如果电话亭已经没有了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.22,1:27:57.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使用时光机器回到那天阻止过去的我们使用如果电话亭
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.14,1:27:58.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.39,1:28:01.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 取物包
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.86,1:28:05.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从地球大雄的房间
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.57,1:28:06.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的桌子
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.40,1:28:14.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到剩下的两人了 追 美杜莎
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.08,1:28:16.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去惩罚他们吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.66,1:28:19.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.50,1:28:27.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到过去
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.26,1:28:28.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现实的世界
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.23,1:28:40.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.81,1:28:42.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后方
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.11,1:28:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.19,1:28:48.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会 时光空间之中会......
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.29,1:28:59.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快逃走
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.21,1:29:01.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.62,1:29:04.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没电了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.63,1:29:13.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么没有注意到 有魔法就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.60,1:29:16.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扫帚
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.76,1:29:17.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明不能飞啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.06,1:29:19.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有这样了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.73,1:29:22.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.44,1:29:23.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.59,1:29:47.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从天上
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.26,1:29:52.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个石像是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.17,1:29:55.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要把这种东西放在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.05,1:29:57.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.60,1:29:58.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的好 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.40,1:30:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能够动了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.32,1:30:13.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 马上如果电话亭就要使用了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.99,1:30:15.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不赶快阻止的话
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.12,1:30:20.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通过圈
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.12,1:30:22.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.38,1:30:34.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月...月光
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.73,1:30:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些破烂是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.39,1:30:47.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,擅自进来的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.90,1:30:49.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明扔在院子里面了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.65,1:30:52.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能的 石像不可能走路的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.36,1:30:54.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快收拾完
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.92,1:31:14.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.26,1:31:17.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.93,1:31:21.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是月光灯
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.26,1:31:25.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是要有这个的话
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.23,1:31:27.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.29,1:31:51.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.54,1:31:54.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快通知外面的我们吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.63,1:31:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 但是怎么做呢
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.09,1:32:01.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之先扔这些周围的东西吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.23,1:32:14.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.36,1:32:15.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子突然
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.69,1:32:18.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意到 注意到
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.90,1:32:23.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 马上就回来
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.20,1:32:27.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快注意到啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.75,1:32:34.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月光灯的效力 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.40,1:32:58.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.99,1:33:00.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.82,1:33:02.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 魔法解开了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.66,1:33:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是这个城堡里我们的魔法好像被封印了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.87,1:33:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么没有逃走的方法吗
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.62,1:33:13.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是大雄和哆啦A梦一定会
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.13,1:33:18.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们因为美杜莎的魔法而变成石像了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.67,1:33:22.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样地球终于就是我们的东西了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.97,1:33:25.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美杜莎大人前去消减月亮的魔力了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.39,1:33:27.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.60,1:33:32.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要征服没有防备的地球真是太容易了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.19,1:33:36.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天魔界星终于要和地球解除了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.40,1:33:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.82,1:33:39.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经这么近了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.49,1:33:45.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天再来料理你们 期待着吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.20,1:33:53.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.26,1:34:06.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回过神了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.43,1:34:08.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦美
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.56,1:34:09.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.22,1:34:19.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世修说哥哥肚子痛的原因可能是次元袋 叫我来看看
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.07,1:34:24.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看了一下里面就发现了变成石像的你们
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.36,1:34:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦美
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.78,1:34:30.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手啊 到底怎么了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.08,1:34:34.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情非常不妙呢
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.96,1:34:39.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.42,1:34:41.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这种事情吗
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.96,1:34:46.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么用如果电话亭就解决了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.55,1:34:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.76,1:34:49.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是我的好妹妹啊
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.10,1:34:51.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就能变回原来的世界了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.43,1:34:55.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万岁 多谢了 哆啦美
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.65,1:35:01.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,[剧终]
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.11,1:35:04.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.86,1:35:11.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有事情问你 取消的话 我们能回到原本的世界
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.29,1:35:15.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法世界呢 在那里的大家会怎样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.50,1:35:18.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.42,1:35:22.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是变成平行世界了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.92,1:35:25.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平什么
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.47,1:35:35.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有关系的 世界这样子 一直持续下去
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.47,1:35:35.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是那边是那边和这边
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.73,1:35:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样美夜子他们会因为我们不去救援而被恶魔们...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.73,1:35:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么 这样不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.54,1:36:03.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去吧 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.51,1:36:08.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差一点就忘记了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.34,1:36:14.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约好了 一定要救美夜子的爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.18,1:36:22.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对美夜子 发誓了 一定会回去救她的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.40,1:36:25.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.40,1:36:28.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了做个了结
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.99,1:36:40.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要吃的话 就吃胖虎 我只有骨头和皮 一点也不好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.12,1:36:43.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要胡说 我都是油而已
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.88,1:36:47.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢油的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.09,1:36:50.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这家伙炸了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.51,1:36:53.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 是要蒸了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.59,1:36:55.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是有两颗星星哦
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.72,1:36:57.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炸了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.22,1:37:02.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白斩吧 我有三颗星星
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.27,1:37:04.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白斩吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.57,1:37:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.99,1:37:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得了了 巨大的蓝色狸猫攻过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.82,1:37:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色狸猫
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.70,1:37:15.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.13,1:37:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家没事情吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.26,1:37:32.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.89,1:37:34.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.05,1:37:37.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来救你们了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.10,1:37:39.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是狸猫
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.60,1:37:41.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.23,1:37:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子变回来了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.65,1:37:46.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起呢
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.07,1:37:50.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快趁通过圈还有效
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.65,1:37:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 你是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.65,1:38:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星星有1 2 3 4 5
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.65,1:38:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...失礼了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.75,1:38:07.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.72,1:38:14.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔毯应该已经烧毁了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.18,1:38:18.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的魔法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.94,1:38:28.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦美
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.24,1:38:34.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样前往月球
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.53,1:38:37.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美杜莎正准备消去月亮的光芒
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.20,1:38:39.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.58,1:38:46.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快进到里面吧 放心 我在魔毯上涂了相反霜
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.71,1:38:55.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们正在前往月球
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.84,1:38:59.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美杜莎已经到了也不一定
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.14,1:39:03.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会被地球人给阻拦吗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.89,1:39:07.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家出去
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.91,1:39:25.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里吗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.67,1:39:35.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明是月亮表面 居然会有这么强的魔力
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.80,1:39:40.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纳鲁尼亚迪斯长久以来让恶魔族痛苦的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.93,1:39:45.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的魔力现在就把你消去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.14,1:39:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.85,1:39:48.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.60,1:39:50.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.65,1:39:52.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球是恶魔族的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.36,1:39:55.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.88,1:40:54.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.13,1:40:57.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道说 那是
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.76,1:41:02.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会 骗人
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.73,1:41:15.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.40,1:41:18.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.24,1:41:22.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种...这种事情
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.11,1:41:23.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.32,1:41:28.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时候和恶魔交换契约的那时候
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.41,1:41:39.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直在戴玛奥身边做恶魔
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.41,1:41:39.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的灵魂就被恶魔俘虏了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.92,1:41:45.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 那种 居然做了那种事情
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.60,1:41:53.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是只是要救你而已
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.90,1:42:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家听好 月光已经消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.45,1:42:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要让阻止我们的人活着
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.24,1:42:09.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.95,1:42:18.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔界星 在魔界星上空的红色之月
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.88,1:42:20.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月亮 月亮怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.01,1:42:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.26,1:42:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是戴玛奥的心脏
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.64,1:42:35.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 不要 不要走
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.36,1:42:45.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子只要你活着的话就......
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.47,1:43:08.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在地球就是我们的东西了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.11,1:43:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子 美夜子 美夜子
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.39,1:43:54.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星星啊 化为雷光将人类们击溃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.23,1:44:06.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回避
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.24,1:44:18.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们想去哪里 难道 不要让他们去
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.75,1:44:20.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是戴玛奥的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.77,1:44:37.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.39,1:44:41.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无法接近
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.31,1:44:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去不行
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.48,1:44:44.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.65,1:44:45.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,数量太多了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.94,1:44:47.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,击溃他们
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.28,1:44:50.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 任意门
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.87,1:44:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.37,1:45:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就将飞镖
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.33,1:45:03.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手 住手
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.50,1:45:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的最后一支
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.67,1:45:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.76,1:45:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎么说这么大的靶子不可能射丢的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.51,1:45:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.01,1:45:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放大灯
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.20,1:50:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说呢 我还是试试把头发留长吧
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.34,1:50:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定很适合的
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.45,1:51:08.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.37,1:51:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下啦
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.53,1:51:10.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在前面
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.03,1:51:17.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把他们30人都打回去了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.03,1:51:17.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隔壁学校的中学生找我来打架
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.25,1:51:19.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像什么事情都没有呢
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.50,1:51:23.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是不是梦呢
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.34,1:51:27.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.06,1:51:36.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHIN KA RA HOI（咒语）
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.45,1:51:48.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.57,1:51:49.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.17,1:52:01.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是风呢
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.38,1:52:06.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,<剧终>
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.51,1:52:14.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 很有趣吧
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.10,1:52:18.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明年还要来看哦
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.00,1:52:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,制作：哆啦俱乐部doraclub.cn\N校对：Mizui Bakufu
